Feature: F05 - Members con Datos Dinámicos (Online Faker)

  @dynamic-member @web @user1
  Scenario Outline: [F05-DYN-<id>] Member con email dinámico
    Given I navigate to Ghost admin login page
    And I login with admin credentials
    And I navigate to the Members section
    Given I click on New member button
    When I fill the member name with the dynamic value
    And I fill the member email with the dynamic value for "<expected>"
    And I save the member
    Then the member creation should result in "<expected>"

    Examples:
      | id | expected |
      | 01 | success  |
      | 02 | success  |
      | 03 | success  |
      | 04 | success  |
      | 05 | success  |
      | 06 | success  |
      | 07 | success  |
      | 08 | success  |
      | 09 | success  |
      | 10 | success  |
      | 11 | error    |
      | 12 | error    |
